WEBVTT

00:08:59.206 --> 00:09:00.659
The list is endless.

00:09:01.367 --> 00:09:03.861
They, to take a single example,

00:09:03.885 --> 00:09:06.881
brought the knowledge of rice cultivation

00:09:06.905 --> 00:09:08.395
to the American South.

00:09:10.101 --> 00:09:14.576
They created some of the most
original civilizational elements

00:09:14.600 --> 00:09:17.442
for which the United States
is now celebrated.

00:09:18.237 --> 00:09:21.337
They deployed their knowledge,
for the most part,

00:09:21.361 --> 00:09:22.881
without compensation.

00:09:23.867 --> 00:09:27.375
For the last half-millennium,
beginning with the slave trade,

00:09:27.399 --> 00:09:30.045
Africa has been exporting brains